{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2344c7fbf015896451e049cf73b19e435837bf5731bd1c154529421136a40366","ja":"結果オーライ！？","zh":"结果好就行！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"00e853dfa9d6f60ca1e511f58f8980f446a62bf0c1b8d971b1279d847834d058","ja":"（みんな、うまく悪い子ができないみたい。\n桃子はどうしようかなあ……）","zh":"（大家似乎都没办法演好坏孩子呢。\n桃子该怎么做才好呢……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"16edeacdc7ca824fbed6d5acbe16df93ffdf222140f73082d5f29014c4804a73","ja":"あら？　桃子、あんた、\n宿題はしないって言ってなかった？","zh":"哎呀？桃子，你不是\n说过不做作业的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"dbbd9c51e10388c8867c2c636f6aa057f113d2fefef23d4c4696cab7716d245a","ja":"あっ……。考え事してたら、つい。\nあれ？　でも伊織さんも……。","zh":"啊……一想事情就忍不住……\n咦？不过伊织也是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c3c023503b6ad81a0dc675a482d19885cce2ae9d9c33aa815ef9157142bed2e1","ja":"あっ！　……習慣って怖いわね。\n私もつい、やっちゃってたわ……。","zh":"啊！……习惯真可怕呢。\n我也一不小心就跟着做了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"16216436c5b82da4dd0de41754414e2d7a9993afd63ae3cac590ed427f10856e","ja":"一時間後……","zh":"一小时后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"bb6002c380bdb4d7ccff9bb929566b53c8685069a381d28e83afa0f0bec5c6a9","ja":"ぜんぜん、うまくできないね。\n他の悪いことを考えた方がいいのかな？","zh":"完全搞不好呢。\n要不要想想别的坏事呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"5324c1f9cc09ba55538abc4fee82591ace6c4c0899929bc8b9052e5ed83af109","ja":"あっ、それじゃあたまき、\r\nおやぶんにいたずらしてくるぞ！","zh":"啊，那环\n去对老大恶作剧啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ed701de23af87d90fac289359fb778b6835c4ae7d58f52c7ad6aead670a6fa48","ja":"わあ、それは悪い子だね！　私も一緒にやろ～っと！\nそれじゃあ、行ってきま～すっ！","zh":"哇，那可真是个坏孩子呢！我也要一起做～！\n那我出发啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"0055831469a9e91bfcd3b5cab2da02348999fe2495e4972643f4920e28f92cd5","ja":"おかえりなさい。\nいたずらは……もしかして、失敗しちゃったの？","zh":"欢迎回来。\n恶作剧……难道是失败了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"a473ee50407c13dd041b98462a740c6cca3c078e051f0778706c76f288fbb938","ja":"うん……お仕事の資料をかくそうとしたら、\n「何かなやんでるのか」って……。","zh":"嗯……我本来想把工作的资料藏起来的，\n却被问“是有什么烦恼吗”……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"2172197bfbd565a99ab3d5bc51a0d58145a99cf6ef1ff06542ce98133c93118a","ja":"すっごく心配してくれるから、\r\nいたずらできなかったんだ……。","zh":"因为你那么担心我，\n我都下不了手搞恶作剧了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"a3024b594ffe7c4a7d77afe1ab629ed955f0b788282ea737efea94670974165d","ja":"もうすぐ撮影は終わりなんだよね？　たまきたち、\nぜんぜん悪い子になれてないぞ……どうしよう？","zh":"马上就要拍完了吧？环她们\n完全没有变成坏孩子啊……怎么办呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"fba96e0aac35035b15cfac79d3cf6557cbfcfd30ebdcde7260c121ad8ea10a92","ja":"「あ、大丈夫ですよ。これはこれでバラエティとして\n面白くなりましたから！　バッチリOKですっ！」","zh":"“啊，没关系的。这样一来，反而作为综艺节目\n变得更有趣了！完全没问题！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"b9ee276580336e2c202d1d3e6e1f26e0917639e28eab7be476bf59945739026b","ja":"ええっ！？　いいの！？\n全然うまくできなかったのに？","zh":"诶！？真的可以吗！？\n明明完全没做好啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"540adf41e0da9559f9e83e226e987717f18ad7c3a563c9a586ef3ee3cbc202e8","ja":"スタッフさんたちがそう言うなら、いいんじゃない？\nでも、悪い子って難しかったね。","zh":"既然工作人员们都这么说了，应该挺好吧？\n不过，演坏孩子还真难呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"7db3d790b0973b7997d3ec469e08bbc4d88cb76a049e1deda73b9b7ffac8dbe3","ja":"うん。悪いことをしようとしたら落ち着かなく\nなって、結局最後までできなかったぞ……。","zh":"嗯。想做坏事的时候心里静不下来，\n结果到最后也没能做成啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1752.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"df2af5a21cc72c2dbd5cf9d65c5f0ef009beb029a60bb20b8da41b32bd110d9c","ja":"演じるならともかく、素の私たちには「悪い子」は\n向いてない、ってことなのかもしれないわね……。","zh":"如果是演戏倒还罢了，但对平时的我们来说，\n或许并不适合当“坏孩子”呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
